grpc-gateway JSON decoder compatibility

The HTTP request decode staging in src/grpc_gateway.rs follows
github.com/grpc-ecosystem/grpc-gateway/v2 v2.29.0
runtime/marshal_jsonpb.go: encoding/json.Decoder into RawMessage followed by
protobuf JSON decoding. Generated Headscale v0.29.5 handlers ignore clean EOF
and drain remaining HTTP body bytes after this single decode.

